<title>UK: Reuters 3rd ex UK-Africa air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 3rd ex UK-Africa air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK air cargo rates to Africa per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		   April 09	  March 27</p>
<p> LON-ACC	 0.95		-</p>
<p> LON-EBB	 1.00		-</p>
<p> LON-HRE	 1.45		-</p>
<p> LON-JNB	 1.60		1.67</p>
<p> LON-LBV	 2.41		2.36</p>
<p> LON-LOS	 0.95		-</p>
<p> LON-NBO	 0.95		0.95</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax: 5017</p>
</text>
